.env
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.md
sitemap.json
*.pdf

# The prompts are source, not notes: without them api/kb.py builds a system
# prompt with no guardrails and no persona, silently. The blanket *.md above
# left them behind on every clone.
!api/prompts/
!api/prompts/*.md

# Derived from kb/raw/ -- rebuilt automatically on API startup, or by hand with
# python kb/embed.py  (see kb/autobuild.py)
/kb/index/
/kb/site_kb.md
